## Features
- Colored ANSI terminal rendering with red/blue bordered 11×11 board
- Union-Find (DSU) win detection — O(α(N)) amortized per check
- Full input validation with stream error recovery
- Monte Carlo AI opponent (HW5)
- Google C++ Style Guide compliant with full Doxygen documentation

## Build & Run
```bash
g++ HexGame_prototype1.cpp -o HexGame && ./HexGame
```

## Tech Stack
- Language: C++11
- Data Structures: Union-Find (Disjoint Set), 2D Vector Board
- Algorithms: Path Compression, Union by Size, Monte Carlo Simulation
- Tools: Doxygen, Google C++ Style Guide, KiCAD (related UAV project)
